 "variants": [
  {
   "id": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Starting next month the neighborhood council will fine anyone who leaves their bins on the sidewalk after 8am.",
   "author": null,
   "step": 0,
   "mutation": "original",
   "emotion": 0.13,
   "extremity": 1.32
  },
  {
   "id": 1,
   "parent": 0,
   "text": "Heads up, the council is officially launching a massive crackdown and will be slapping us all with heavy fines if our bins are out even a minute past 8am. They’re basically turning our neighborhood into a police state with these insane new mandates.",
   "author": 43,
   "step": 1,
   "mutation": "exaggerate",
   "emotion": 3.91,
   "extremity": 3.63
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "parent": 0,
   "text": "The council is officially launching a massive crackdown next month, hitting anyone with a fine if their bins are out for even a second past 8am. They’re finally turning this neighborhood into a total police state with these insane new rules.",
   "author": 59,
   "step": 1,
   "mutation": "exaggerate",
   "emotion": 3.8000000000000003,
   "extremity": 3.67
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "parent": 1,
   "text": "I’ve heard a rumor that the council might be tightening bin collection rules, though it sounds a bit exaggerated. It’s hard to say if there’s any truth to the talk about fines, but we might want to keep an eye on our timing just in case.",
   "author": 42,
   "step": 2,
   "mutation": "soften",
   "emotion": 0.44,
   "extremity": 0.04
  },
  {
   "id": 4,
   "parent": 2,
   "text": "I heard some talk that the council might be planning stricter bin enforcement next month, though it’s hard to say if that’s actually true. Seems like they might just be adding more unnecessary rules to the pile.",
   "author": 58,
   "step": 2,
   "mutation": "soften",
   "emotion": 1.03,
   "extremity": 0.21
  },
  {
   "id": 5,
   "parent": 4,
   "text": "I heard from Mrs. Gable that the council is finally planning stricter bin enforcement next month, which is about time. Honestly, they should have cracked down on those sidewalk eyesores ages ago!",
   "author": 50,
   "step": 3,
   "mutation": "add_detail",
   "emotion": 1.44,
   "extremity": 1.24
  }
 ],
